  "plain": "At the 1948 saucer crash said to have happened in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, a \"dragon wagon\", a heavy military hauling truck, is said to have backed up a freshly cut road to carry the craft away. Michels narrates the scene himself and draws on the writer Frank Scully and his book Behind the Flying Saucers. If it happened, the military moved quickly and on a large scale to remove a whole craft from the site."
